    (erased (Iter f 2 w s2) it) (erased (ConvOk r u q) cv) (erased (Length (Sub) r a) l) (erased (Pw (Sec) (Sub) FitSec osz r) fz)
    -> (erased (InRg nhub u) iu) (erased (Pw (Sec) (Sub) FitSec osw q) fw))
